 #define BNX_BITS 5
 inline constexpr int BNX_TAB[2] = { 0x424E5831, BNX_BITS }; // slot 0 magic keeps it out of .bss
+// CNS (b2421, Econ spec_cns_1113, witness 01a1d68d v Fish: our Marcella carry flip-flops between the squad stick and the rate switch).
+// Runtime data flag, read first; 0 = v911. Bit 1: choose_target's squad stick is skipped when I am a roster carry (cltf_kind != 0).
